OL,4,BVerstappen wins extraordinary race as  
OL,5,BFerraris collide                       
OL,6,GRed Bull's Max Verstappen won an       
OL,7,Gextraordinary Las Vegas Grand Prix     
OL,8,Gthat featured 34 lead changes in a non-
OL,9,Gstop battle at the front.              
OL,11,FThe leading group of 10 cars were tied 
OL,12,Ftogether for the vast majority of the  
OL,13,Frace as the lead constantly changed    
OL,14,Fhands between Verstappen and the       
OL,15,FMercedes drivers George Russell and    
OL,16,FKimi Antonelli.                        
OL,18,FBut Verstappen was the one constant,   
OL,19,Falways seeming a step ahead of his     
OL,20,Frivals as he debated electrical energy 
OL,21,Fdeployment strategy with his team.     
